// The usage pages this module used to hold now live in
// components/<slug>.usage.gts; what remains here is the fixtures they
// share. The header below describes those pages, not this file.
// Pretui — demo-motion-core: freestyle usage pages for the four motion
// primitives (Presence, InView, SlidingHighlight, ScrollProgress). None of
// the upstreams ship a knob rig — motion-primitives and react-bits publish
// docs sites with fixed examples — so every knob set is derived from the
// Pretui signature. Two pages need a scroll container to demonstrate at all
// (InView, ScrollProgress); those build one inside the example so the effect
// is reachable without leaving the workbench. Demo copy speaks the tea-trade
// fiction from examples.gts.

export const PRESETS = ['fade', 'rise', 'fall', 'scale', 'slide'];

